     "head": "Carbon dioxide",
     "group": "co2",
     "inFilm": "airchange",
     "step": 2,
     "title": true,
     "text": "Inspired air contains about 0.04 % carbon dioxide, and expired air about 4 %. Supplement: carbon dioxide is produced by aerobic respiration in the cells, and it diffuses from the blood into the alveoli."
