     "step": 3,
     "title": true,
     "text": "The water vapour in inspired air varies with the weather. Expired air contains more water vapour. Expired air holds as much water vapour as air can hold at this temperature: expired air is saturated. Supplement: water evaporates from the moist surface of the alveoli, and water is also produced by respiration."
